stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ARMED
  ARMED --> COUNTING: condition true
  COUNTING --> COUNTING: new unique match below required count
  COUNTING --> PREPARED: required consecutive matches + cooldown passed
  COUNTING --> ARMED: condition false / rearm
  PREPARED --> ACTION_IN_PROGRESS: durable prepare committed
  ACTION_IN_PROGRESS --> FINALIZED: actuator/BLE outcome persisted
  FINALIZED --> DISARMED: trigger complete
  DISARMED --> ARMED: condition false
  ACTION_IN_PROGRESS --> OUTCOME_UNKNOWN: restart; physical action is not replayed
